speechtext:
I am
informed by Crown Assets Disposal Corporation as follows:
1. Yes.
(a)	(i) Mr. V. Prsychowski, President, VEBEG Ver-wertungsgesellschaft m.b.h.;
(ii)	Mr. K. Cron, President, VEBEG Verwertungs-gesellschaft m.b.h.;
(iii)	Dr. W. Diestelmeier Ministry of Defence;
(iv)	Mr. Ernst Knebel Ministerialdirigent Im, Bonn;
(v)	Mr. Reginald Berger
Germany Ministry of Defence, Bonn.
(b)	June 4, 5, 6, 1980.
(c)	June 4-Frankfurt, at the officials' respective offices. June 5 and 6-Bonn, at the officials' respective offices. During normal business hours.
(d)	Final contract executed with VEBEG, German disposal techniques, financial implications of disposal activities, expanded base for disposal of Canadian Government Surplus abroad.
2. (i) Schlosshotel, Frankfurt Bristol Hotel, Bonn;
(ii) The cost to the corporation is $471.
